## 2. Manager White Screen Bug

**Root Cause:** [RestaurantDashboard.jsx](file:///c:/Users/gikiw/OneDrive/Desktop/NaanNow/frontend/src/pages/RestaurantDashboard/RestaurantDashboard.jsx#L349) accesses `selectedRestaurant.menu` unconditionally on line 349. When `currentUser` is still `null` (async fetch in progress), the early-return guard on line 198 only covers the case when `currentUser` is already loaded and approved. The code falls through to line 349 where `selectedRestaurant` is also null → crash → white screen.

**Fix:** Add a loading guard at the top of the component render:
```js
if (!currentUser) {
  return <div className="dashboard-loading">Loading...</div>;
}
```
This goes before line 198, so nothing renders until the user is fetched.

#### [MODIFY] [RestaurantDashboard.jsx](file:///c:/Users/gikiw/OneDrive/Desktop/NaanNow/frontend/src/pages/RestaurantDashboard/RestaurantDashboard.jsx)
- Add `if (!currentUser) return <div className="dashboard-loading">Loading...</div>;` before line 198

