## 3. Protected Routes (Cart, Wishlist, Checkout, Orders, Favorites)

**Root Cause:** No auth guard exists on the frontend routes. All customer-facing pages (favorites, checkout, orders, profile, cart sidebar) are accessible without login. The wishlist (`toggleFavorite`) and cart (`addToCart`) operations work purely in client-side state with no login check.

**Fix:** Create a `ProtectedRoute` wrapper component and wrap all authenticated routes in `App.jsx`.

#### [NEW] [ProtectedRoute.jsx](file:///c:/Users/gikiw/OneDrive/Desktop/NaanNow/frontend/src/components/ProtectedRoute.jsx)
- A simple component that checks `useAuth().user`; if null, redirect to `/login`
- Renders `<Outlet />` or children if authenticated

#### [MODIFY] [App.jsx](file:///c:/Users/gikiw/OneDrive/Desktop/NaanNow/frontend/src/App.jsx)
- Wrap `/favorites`, `/checkout`, `/orders`, `/track-order/:orderId`, `/profile` routes inside `<ProtectedRoute />`

#### [MODIFY] [CartSideBar.jsx](file:///c:/Users/gikiw/OneDrive/Desktop/NaanNow/frontend/src/components/Cart%20Side%20Bar/CartSideBar.jsx)
- When "Proceed to Checkout" is clicked, check if user is logged in; if not, navigate to `/login`
- When the cart opens (via cart icon click), check auth and redirect if not logged in

#### [MODIFY] [Navbar.jsx](file:///c:/Users/gikiw/OneDrive/Desktop/NaanNow/frontend/src/components/Navbar/Navbar.jsx)
- Cart icon click: check auth → if not logged in, navigate to `/login` instead of opening cart
- Wishlist icon click: check auth → if not logged in, navigate to `/login`
- Orders tab click: check auth → if not logged in, navigate to `/login`

#### [MODIFY] [RestaurantGrid.jsx](file:///c:/Users/gikiw/OneDrive/Desktop/NaanNow/frontend/src/components/RestaurantGrid/RestaurantGrid.jsx)
- Wishlist button click: check auth → if not logged in, navigate to `/login`

