## 6. Hardcoded Address on All Screens

**Root Cause:** [Navbar.jsx](file:///c:/Users/gikiw/OneDrive/Desktop/NaanNow/frontend/src/components/Navbar/Navbar.jsx#L21-L23) initializes address from `localStorage` with a hardcoded fallback `'Street 11 Islamabad'`. The user's `address` field from the database is never used to set the displayed address.

**Fix:** When a user is logged in, initialize the address from `user.address` from the database (falling back to localStorage, then default).

#### [MODIFY] [Navbar.jsx](file:///c:/Users/gikiw/OneDrive/Desktop/NaanNow/frontend/src/components/Navbar/Navbar.jsx)
- Add a `useEffect` that watches `currentUser` — when user is logged in and has an `address`, set it as the displayed address
- When saving address via modal, also update the user's address in the DB via `api.updateProfile`

